ebm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097850/extras/bf6ce1a704f48dfcd5b70a0cf263a625.mp4?t=1705337843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Unique Visual Appeal</h2>Inspired by the renowned filmmaker Tim Burton, the visuals of Jewel Run combine a dark and twisted atmosphere with vibrant and colorful visuals, creating a truly one-of-a-kind gaming experience. Players will experience a world unlike any other, filled with strange and intriguing characters and locations that are sure to leave a lasting impression.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097850/extras/68ed0f4dc01cb1bb9564f5a8ca3a83bd.poster.avif?t=1705337843\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097850/extras/68ed0f4dc01cb1bb9564f5a8ca3a83bd.webm?t=1705337843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097850/extras/68ed0f4dc01cb1bb9564f5a8ca3a83bd.mp4?t=1705337843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
